- **Release recovery:** Inherited a 6-week release delay. Identified the root cause: changed and missed requirements were being absorbed into existing tickets, which hid delivery gaps. Introduced mandatory prioritization for every new ask, separate tickets for separate work, and defect classification standards. This stabilized the pipeline and moved the release forward from September 15 to August 15.
